      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T02:27:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks wrong to me to add special cases like this for native bridge. Shouldn\u0027t it be handled in the arch mutator along with the other arches? Not that it\u0027s something to address in this CL, but it seems like the grafted-on native bridge variants are creating more tech debt here.",
